1
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:13,106
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦他…</c.simplifiedchinese>

2
00:00:13,192 --> 00:00:16,820
<c.simplifiedchinese>是神谷活心流重要的后继者</c.simplifiedchinese>

3
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:30,640
<c.simplifiedchinese>（原作：和月伸宏
集英社《周刊少年JUMP》）</c.simplifiedchinese>

4
00:02:00,322 --> 00:02:01,449
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦不见了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

5
00:02:01,533 --> 00:02:03,076
<c.simplifiedchinese>是啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

6
00:02:03,161 --> 00:02:07,331
<c.simplifiedchinese>话说回来 他最近确实经常不见呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

7
00:02:07,420 --> 00:02:10,590
<c.simplifiedchinese>-是吧？
-是不是交女朋友了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

8
00:02:10,676 --> 00:02:12,678
<c.simplifiedchinese>还真是早熟啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

9
00:02:12,764 --> 00:02:16,142
<c.simplifiedchinese>我敢打赌他一定去吃好吃的了</c.simplifiedchinese>

10
00:02:16,228 --> 00:02:18,063
<c.simplifiedchinese>他能吃这点倒像个大人</c.simplifiedchinese>

11
00:02:18,149 --> 00:02:22,695
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下认为他是一个人去练剑了</c.simplifiedchinese>

12
00:02:22,784 --> 00:02:27,455
<c.simplifiedchinese>他也是时候形成自己的剑术风格了</c.simplifiedchinese>

13
00:02:27,543 --> 00:02:29,212
<c.simplifiedchinese>-怎么可能！
-怎么可能！</c.simplifiedchinese>

14
00:02:29,297 --> 00:02:30,673
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吗…</c.simplifiedchinese>

15
00:02:30,758 --> 00:02:33,344
<c.simplifiedchinese>女朋友 一定是女朋友</c.simplifiedchinese>

16
00:02:33,430 --> 00:02:35,057
<c.simplifiedchinese>吃的 去买吃的了</c.simplifiedchinese>

17
00:02:35,141 --> 00:02:36,559
<c.simplifiedchinese>绝对是</c.simplifiedchinese>

18
00:02:36,645 --> 00:02:37,646
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下觉得是剑术…</c.simplifiedchinese>

19
00:02:37,730 --> 00:02:39,315
<c.simplifiedchinese>-怎么可能！
-怎么可能！</c.simplifiedchinese>

20
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:40,276
<c.simplifiedchinese>吃的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

21
00:02:40,361 --> 00:02:41,237
<c.simplifiedchinese>女朋友！</c.simplifiedchinese>

22
00:02:41,863 --> 00:02:45,200
<c.simplifiedchinese>干嘛把自己的欲望大声嚷嚷出来？</c.simplifiedchinese>

23
00:02:45,286 --> 00:02:46,204
<c.simplifiedchinese>真丢人</c.simplifiedchinese>

24
00:02:46,288 --> 00:02:47,623
<c.simplifiedchinese>-小屁孩！
-小屁孩！</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:02:47,708 --> 00:02:48,876
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是的</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:02:48,961 --> 00:02:50,337
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在的孩子啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

27
00:02:51,466 --> 00:02:52,551
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么情况？</c.simplifiedchinese>

28
00:02:55,056 --> 00:02:56,975
<c.simplifiedchinese>你去哪了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:02:57,060 --> 00:02:57,894
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦</c.simplifiedchinese>

30
00:02:58,647 --> 00:02:59,898
<c.simplifiedchinese>散步而已</c.simplifiedchinese>

31
00:03:00,734 --> 00:03:03,279
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果因为散步甚至在练习上偷懒</c.simplifiedchinese>

32
00:03:03,365 --> 00:03:05,409
<c.simplifiedchinese>那不能叫做散步“而已”</c.simplifiedchinese>

33
00:03:07,623 --> 00:03:09,417
<c.simplifiedchinese>今天早上我练习了挥剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

34
00:03:09,502 --> 00:03:13,840
<c.simplifiedchinese>一周六天训练我有参加四次 没事的</c.simplifiedchinese>

35
00:03:13,927 --> 00:03:16,054
<c.simplifiedchinese>别担心了</c.simplifiedchinese>

36
00:03:21,651 --> 00:03:24,571
<c.simplifiedchinese>（于是几天后）</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:03:30,293 --> 00:03:31,210
<c.simplifiedchinese>好</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:03:35,721 --> 00:03:37,514
<c.simplifiedchinese>太可疑了</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:03:37,600 --> 00:03:39,852
<c.simplifiedchinese>他好像有事瞒着我们</c.simplifiedchinese>

40
00:03:39,938 --> 00:03:42,607
<c.simplifiedchinese>也好 正好打发下时间</c.simplifiedchinese>

41
00:03:45,198 --> 00:03:46,449
<c.simplifiedchinese>我就说是女朋友</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:03:46,534 --> 00:03:48,119
<c.simplifiedchinese>一定是吃的</c.simplifiedchinese>

43
00:03:48,204 --> 00:03:51,040
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下还是觉得他在练习剑术…</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:03:51,670 --> 00:03:52,587
<c.simplifiedchinese>（红牛牛锅 酒馆）</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:03:52,672 --> 00:03:55,132
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么呀 这不是红牛酒馆吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:03:55,218 --> 00:03:58,388
<c.simplifiedchinese>你看 这不是吃东西吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

47
00:03:58,475 --> 00:03:59,726
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:04:00,562 --> 00:04:02,648
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以他才偷偷摸摸进来…</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:04:04,027 --> 00:04:06,154
<c.simplifiedchinese>诶 他人呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:07,741
<c.simplifiedchinese>好奇怪</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:04:07,827 --> 00:04:09,954
<c.simplifiedchinese>明明看见他进来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:04:10,039 --> 00:04:11,499
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎呀 小薰</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:04:11,584 --> 00:04:13,003
<c.simplifiedchinese>欢迎光临</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:04:13,087 --> 00:04:14,755
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有空位</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:04:14,841 --> 00:04:15,883
<c.simplifiedchinese>快请坐吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:04:15,968 --> 00:04:17,886
<c.simplifiedchinese>噢 打扰了</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:04:17,972 --> 00:04:19,473
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么呀！</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:04:19,559 --> 00:04:21,019
<c.simplifiedchinese>妙小姐 那个…</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:04:23,483 --> 00:04:24,693
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 小子！</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:04:24,777 --> 00:04:26,446
<c.simplifiedchinese>木炭用完了</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:04:26,531 --> 00:04:28,199
<c.simplifiedchinese>再拿一袋来</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:04:28,284 --> 00:04:29,160
<c.simplifiedchinese>知道了</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:04:29,244 --> 00:04:31,329
<c.simplifiedchinese>告诉燕也拿一袋来</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:04:31,415 --> 00:04:35,419
<c.simplifiedchinese>客人越来越多了
拿完接着去招待客人</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:04:36,091 --> 00:04:37,176
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:04:37,260 --> 00:04:38,636
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:04:38,722 --> 00:04:41,224
<c.simplifiedchinese>他白天在这里做兼职啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:04:41,310 --> 00:04:43,479
<c.simplifiedchinese>他不让我们告诉别人</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:04:43,565 --> 00:04:47,944
<c.simplifiedchinese>有一天他突然过来工作
还要求我们保密</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:04:48,032 --> 00:04:49,658
<c.simplifiedchinese>他为什么要…</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:04:50,746 --> 00:04:52,539
<c.simplifiedchinese>也许那就是他的目的</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:04:52,625 --> 00:04:53,751
<c.simplifiedchinese>哪个？</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:04:54,921 --> 00:04:56,589
<c.simplifiedchinese>小燕吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:04:56,674 --> 00:04:58,760
<c.simplifiedchinese>不可能吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:04:58,845 --> 00:05:02,682
<c.simplifiedchinese>她在弥彦之后才来店里工作的</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:05:02,770 --> 00:05:04,688
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在干什么啊？</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:05:04,774 --> 00:05:06,442
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起 弥彦弟弟</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:05:06,527 --> 00:05:08,487
<c.simplifiedchinese>我说过不要叫我“弟弟”吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:05:08,573 --> 00:05:09,407
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:05:13,165 --> 00:05:16,418
<c.simplifiedchinese>别那么紧张兮兮 畏畏缩缩的</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:05:16,505 --> 00:05:19,675
<c.simplifiedchinese>我最讨厌这样了</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:05:19,762 --> 00:05:21,013
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦弟弟…</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:05:21,098 --> 00:05:22,432
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦…</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:05:22,517 --> 00:05:25,395
<c.simplifiedchinese>腿和腰部训练也是剑术训练的一部分</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:05:25,481 --> 00:05:27,942
<c.simplifiedchinese>好了 快去招待客人吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:05:31,076 --> 00:05:34,037
<c.simplifiedchinese>吃的、女孩、剑术训练</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:05:34,124 --> 00:05:36,751
<c.simplifiedchinese>全都有啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:05:36,838 --> 00:05:40,341
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是他没有这么做的动机啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:05:40,428 --> 00:05:42,597
<c.simplifiedchinese>只是为了赚点零花钱吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:05:42,683 --> 00:05:46,729
<c.simplifiedchinese>那他为什么要瞒着我们呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:05:47,735 --> 00:05:53,282
<c.simplifiedchinese>也许他想帮忙减轻
神谷道场的经济负担呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:05:53,370 --> 00:05:54,705
<c.simplifiedchinese>不可能</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:05:54,790 --> 00:05:56,918
<c.simplifiedchinese>他才没那么高尚</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:05:57,003 --> 00:05:58,296
<c.simplifiedchinese>你快别说话了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:05:58,380 --> 00:05:59,798
<c.simplifiedchinese>你自己不也是总吃白食！</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:05:59,884 --> 00:06:02,011
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂！点个菜怎么磨磨蹭蹭的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:06:02,096 --> 00:06:02,972
<c.simplifiedchinese>好…</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:06:03,057 --> 00:06:04,058
<c.simplifiedchinese>来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:06:04,142 --> 00:06:06,770
<c.simplifiedchinese>抱歉让您久等了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:06:09,027 --> 00:06:10,403
<c.simplifiedchinese>呦</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:06:10,989 --> 00:06:13,241
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的表情怎么这么难看？</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:06:13,327 --> 00:06:16,205
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是对主人做鬼脸吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:06:18,755 --> 00:06:20,382
<c.simplifiedchinese>呼 好累</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:06:21,051 --> 00:06:24,137
<c.simplifiedchinese>这比薰的训练还辛苦</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:06:24,224 --> 00:06:26,601
<c.simplifiedchinese>但为了得到那个</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:06:26,687 --> 00:06:28,230
<c.simplifiedchinese>我可不能抱怨啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:06:29,401 --> 00:06:32,779
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过那个究竟要多少钱啊？</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:06:40,423 --> 00:06:42,425
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以…怎么样？</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:06:43,847 --> 00:06:46,016
<c.simplifiedchinese>问你话呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:06:47,855 --> 00:06:50,399
<c.simplifiedchinese>红牛酒馆店里没有多少钱</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:06:50,484 --> 00:06:53,863
<c.simplifiedchinese>店主每天都把当天的收入带回自己家</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:06:54,827 --> 00:06:56,495
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟我预料的一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:06:57,498 --> 00:06:58,708
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:06:59,711 --> 00:07:01,796
<c.simplifiedchinese>看看你是不是照我的吩咐</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:07:01,883 --> 00:07:05,636
<c.simplifiedchinese>做了店主房间和钱箱的钥匙模子</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:07:06,934 --> 00:07:09,854
<c.simplifiedchinese>不…不能这样 干雄大人</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:07:09,940 --> 00:07:13,861
<c.simplifiedchinese>盗窃有损长冈家的名誉！</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:07:14,574 --> 00:07:15,825
<c.simplifiedchinese>你…</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:07:15,911 --> 00:07:19,664
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么时候轮到你对我指手画脚了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:07:19,751 --> 00:07:21,878
<c.simplifiedchinese>江户三百多年</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:07:21,964 --> 00:07:26,886
<c.simplifiedchinese>你那贫穷的武士家族
一直为我的家族服务！</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:07:26,974 --> 00:07:30,061
<c.simplifiedchinese>但新政府上台后</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:07:30,147 --> 00:07:33,609
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们突然就变成毫无关系的陌生人了</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:07:33,695 --> 00:07:36,407
<c.simplifiedchinese>明治真是一个讨厌的时代</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:07:36,493 --> 00:07:38,703
<c.simplifiedchinese>已经没有忠义可言</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:07:38,789 --> 00:07:40,958
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们鼓吹四民平等</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:07:41,044 --> 00:07:44,923
<c.simplifiedchinese>践踏了三百多年的恩义</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:07:45,010 --> 00:07:45,845
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:07:45,929 --> 00:07:47,931
<c.simplifiedchinese>这可是强盗行为…</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:07:48,725 --> 00:07:50,811
<c.simplifiedchinese>我知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:07:50,897 --> 00:07:53,733
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不会再对一个陌生人发号施令了</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:07:54,237 --> 00:07:56,906
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会按我的方法做</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:07:56,993 --> 00:08:01,539
<c.simplifiedchinese>没有钥匙 只能把店里的人都杀了</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:08:01,626 --> 00:08:05,630
<c.simplifiedchinese>不然留下目击者 会损害长冈家名誉</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:08:06,470 --> 00:08:10,849
<c.simplifiedchinese>只能连那个叫妙的一起杀了</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:08:15,738 --> 00:08:17,281
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就对了</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:08:17,366 --> 00:08:18,409
<c.simplifiedchinese>蠢货！</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:21,539
<c.simplifiedchinese>进入明治时代已经十年了</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:08:21,625 --> 00:08:24,211
<c.simplifiedchinese>你还执着于什么“主从”关系啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:08:24,297 --> 00:08:25,131
<c.simplifiedchinese>谁啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:08:25,216 --> 00:08:27,301
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟你说话呢 鬓角混蛋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:08:27,386 --> 00:08:31,182
<c.simplifiedchinese>同为武士后裔 我绝不能放过你</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:08:31,269 --> 00:08:32,270
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦弟弟</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:08:32,355 --> 00:08:34,815
<c.simplifiedchinese>都说了不要叫“弟弟”！</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:08:38,825 --> 00:08:39,743
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂！</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:08:39,827 --> 00:08:41,955
<c.simplifiedchinese>快放弃那些愚蠢的强盗想法吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:08:42,041 --> 00:08:46,837
<c.simplifiedchinese>否则我东京武士族明神弥彦
会出手收拾你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:08:46,925 --> 00:08:48,134
<c.simplifiedchinese>住嘴！</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:08:48,220 --> 00:08:50,222
<c.simplifiedchinese>-小鬼！
-身体！</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:08:50,307 --> 00:08:51,433
<c.simplifiedchinese>你…</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:08:53,105 --> 00:08:53,939
<c.simplifiedchinese>我可以</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:08:54,023 --> 00:08:56,025
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的剑术训练有效果</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:08:56,111 --> 00:08:57,529
<c.simplifiedchinese>-臭小子！
-来啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:09:00,244 --> 00:09:01,453
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个给我</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:09:05,379 --> 00:09:06,297
<c.simplifiedchinese>就是现在！</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:09:06,381 --> 00:09:07,966
<c.simplifiedchinese>围住他 给我打！</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:09:10,848 --> 00:09:11,682
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰！</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:09:11,766 --> 00:09:14,936
<c.simplifiedchinese>你怎么还能悠闲地看戏？</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:09:15,649 --> 00:09:18,277
<c.simplifiedchinese>他说得对 弥彦有危险</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:09:18,363 --> 00:09:20,282
<c.simplifiedchinese>冷静点</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:09:20,367 --> 00:09:22,244
<c.simplifiedchinese>我怎么冷静得了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:09:22,330 --> 00:09:24,749
<c.simplifiedchinese>那孩子可是我的宝贝首席弟子</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:09:24,834 --> 00:09:26,210
<c.simplifiedchinese>先等一下</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:09:26,296 --> 00:09:29,674
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦还没有发现我们在这</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:09:29,761 --> 00:09:32,930
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们突然出现会很不自然</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:09:33,017 --> 00:09:33,893
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:09:33,977 --> 00:09:35,771
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果总是等别人来拯救</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:09:35,856 --> 00:09:38,776
<c.simplifiedchinese>他永远也不会变强</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:09:39,364 --> 00:09:41,074
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是弥彦的战斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:09:41,743 --> 00:09:44,204
<c.simplifiedchinese>只要他不寻求我们的帮助</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:09:44,290 --> 00:09:47,460
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们没有必要出手</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:09:48,298 --> 00:09:52,928
<c.simplifiedchinese>效仿“狮子把幼崽推到谷底”
来锻炼他啊…</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:09:53,433 --> 00:09:54,434
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过…</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:09:55,104 --> 00:09:56,146
<c.simplifiedchinese>停手！</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:09:56,231 --> 00:09:58,775
<c.simplifiedchinese>求你了 让他们停手 干雄大人！</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:09:58,860 --> 00:10:00,612
<c.simplifiedchinese>这件事与他无关</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:10:00,698 --> 00:10:02,658
<c.simplifiedchinese>我把钥匙模子给你就是</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:10:04,330 --> 00:10:05,790
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂！</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:10:05,874 --> 00:10:08,252
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们还有更重要的事做</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:10:08,338 --> 00:10:09,673
<c.simplifiedchinese>放开他吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:10:09,757 --> 00:10:10,967
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:10:14,015 --> 00:10:15,183
<c.simplifiedchinese>你还好吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:10:15,269 --> 00:10:16,395
<c.simplifiedchinese>该死！</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:10:16,479 --> 00:10:18,940
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果是一对一 我早把他们打败了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:10:19,025 --> 00:10:20,402
<c.simplifiedchinese>燕</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:10:20,487 --> 00:10:23,282
<c.simplifiedchinese>今后也要为主人效力哦</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:10:24,495 --> 00:10:25,872
<c.simplifiedchinese>回见</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:10:25,956 --> 00:10:27,499
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦弟弟</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:10:30,006 --> 00:10:31,466
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:10:31,551 --> 00:10:34,012
<c.simplifiedchinese>把你卷进这种事…</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:10:34,640 --> 00:10:35,933
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的对不起</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:10:39,650 --> 00:10:45,198
<c.simplifiedchinese>用模具做出钥匙 最少也要一天时间</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:10:45,287 --> 00:10:47,915
<c.simplifiedchinese>也就是说 他们明晚之后才能行动</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:49,460
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦弟弟？</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:10:49,545 --> 00:10:50,630
<c.simplifiedchinese>没关系啦</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:10:51,341 --> 00:10:55,094
<c.simplifiedchinese>连这种小混混都打不过
我的确还是“弥彦弟弟”</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:10:55,849 --> 00:11:00,687
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且不是你把我卷进来
是我主动插手帮你</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:11:01,444 --> 00:11:03,655
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以你别内疚了</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:11:09,502 --> 00:11:10,753
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦弟弟…</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:11:12,925 --> 00:11:14,885
<c.simplifiedchinese>不能告诉警察</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:11:14,971 --> 00:11:17,848
<c.simplifiedchinese>不然她会被当成共犯的</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:11:17,935 --> 00:11:20,479
<c.simplifiedchinese>也不能请剑心他们帮忙</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:11:21,066 --> 00:11:25,737
<c.simplifiedchinese>对付那些流氓 不能麻烦剑心他们</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:11:27,246 --> 00:11:30,207
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是我的战斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:11:34,175 --> 00:11:36,803
<c.simplifiedchinese>（第二天早上）</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:11:38,017 --> 00:11:40,519
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯 差不多做完了</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:11:40,606 --> 00:11:42,899
<c.simplifiedchinese>那是什么玩具啊？</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:11:42,985 --> 00:11:43,861
<c.simplifiedchinese>蠢货！</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:11:43,945 --> 00:11:47,616
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是为了练习同时对抗多个敌人
而设计的训练器</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:11:47,703 --> 00:11:49,079
<c.simplifiedchinese>没用的</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:11:49,665 --> 00:11:50,958
<c.simplifiedchinese>那种东西没用的</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:11:51,043 --> 00:11:52,419
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:11:52,504 --> 00:11:53,672
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然了</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:11:53,757 --> 00:11:57,510
<c.simplifiedchinese>木板的移动方式是固定的</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:11:57,598 --> 00:11:59,808
<c.simplifiedchinese>真正的对手可没有固定的套路</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:11:59,894 --> 00:12:04,815
<c.simplifiedchinese>联合式、波浪式、包围式
以各种复杂形式进行攻击</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:12:05,739 --> 00:12:10,285
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算它能锻炼你的反射神经
也不是一朝一夕就能做到的</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:12:11,876 --> 00:12:13,795
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是小孩子的天真想法</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:12:14,548 --> 00:12:15,883
<c.simplifiedchinese>烦死了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:12:18,640 --> 00:12:20,016
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:12:20,101 --> 00:12:20,976
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:12:21,061 --> 00:12:22,854
<c.simplifiedchinese>我能问你一件事吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:12:22,940 --> 00:12:25,359
<c.simplifiedchinese>我想知道同时一对多的方法</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:12:25,445 --> 00:12:27,364
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么突然想起问这个？</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:12:28,702 --> 00:12:31,204
<c.simplifiedchinese>反正我就是想知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:12:33,795 --> 00:12:35,004
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:12:35,507 --> 00:12:38,635
<c.simplifiedchinese>其实在下知道一个办法</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:12:38,722 --> 00:12:39,889
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:12:39,974 --> 00:12:41,434
<c.simplifiedchinese>那是幕末时期</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:12:41,519 --> 00:12:45,189
<c.simplifiedchinese>维新志士在人数劣势时使用的方法</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:12:45,736 --> 00:12:48,196
<c.simplifiedchinese>你先逃走</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:12:48,282 --> 00:12:49,908
<c.simplifiedchinese>-逃走？
-对</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:12:50,996 --> 00:12:54,499
<c.simplifiedchinese>准确来说是假装逃走</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:12:55,254 --> 00:12:57,047
<c.simplifiedchinese>敌人当然会来追你</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:12:57,133 --> 00:12:59,844
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为个体差异 每个人速度不同</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:12:59,930 --> 00:13:03,601
<c.simplifiedchinese>会自然而然地按快慢形成队列</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:13:03,688 --> 00:13:08,443
<c.simplifiedchinese>你利用这点
转身消灭第一个追兵 然后再逃跑</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:13:09,032 --> 00:13:10,200
<c.simplifiedchinese>重复几次</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:13:10,284 --> 00:13:15,623
<c.simplifiedchinese>就能全灭敌人 甚至可以毫发无伤</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:13:15,712 --> 00:13:16,880
<c.simplifiedchinese>我懂了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:13:16,964 --> 00:13:21,761
<c.simplifiedchinese>但要做到这一点
久经锻炼的出色脚力必不可少</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:13:22,518 --> 00:13:23,685
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此…</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:13:23,770 --> 00:13:27,732
<c.simplifiedchinese>重点是寻找和敌人一对一战斗的机会</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:13:28,445 --> 00:13:30,739
<c.simplifiedchinese>这一点你仔细想想吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:13:31,326 --> 00:13:34,454
<c.simplifiedchinese>和敌人一对一战斗的机会…</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:13:35,376 --> 00:13:36,293
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:13:37,004 --> 00:13:39,674
<c.simplifiedchinese>神谷活心流是救人剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:13:39,760 --> 00:13:43,264
<c.simplifiedchinese>是为了他人而挥舞 保护别人的剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:13:44,227 --> 00:13:45,395
<c.simplifiedchinese>一把剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:13:45,479 --> 00:13:49,066
<c.simplifiedchinese>同时关系着你自己和要保护的人
两个人的命运</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:13:49,572 --> 00:13:53,951
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果输了 不仅是自己
要保护的人也会受到伤害</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:13:54,582 --> 00:13:58,377
<c.simplifiedchinese>挥舞救人剑的剑客绝不能失败</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:13:59,048 --> 00:14:01,217
<c.simplifiedchinese>这一点你一定要记住</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:14:09,945 --> 00:14:13,282
<c.simplifiedchinese>（红牛酒馆 店主家）</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:14:14,245 --> 00:14:15,622
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 我们走</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:14:15,707 --> 00:14:18,585
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们真的要这么做吗 干雄大人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:14:18,671 --> 00:14:19,714
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:14:19,798 --> 00:14:22,051
<c.simplifiedchinese>事到如今你还怕什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:14:22,136 --> 00:14:23,012
<c.simplifiedchinese>我跟你说过吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:14:23,096 --> 00:14:27,434
<c.simplifiedchinese>商人的钱本来是属于我们武士族的</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:14:27,521 --> 00:14:31,150
<c.simplifiedchinese>直接拿走有什么关系？</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:14:31,238 --> 00:14:33,406
<c.simplifiedchinese>更何况我们不可能失败</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:14:33,492 --> 00:14:36,995
<c.simplifiedchinese>为了这个还特意配了钥匙…</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:14:40,381 --> 00:14:41,882
<c.simplifiedchinese>你是昨天那个…</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:14:41,968 --> 00:14:43,886
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这小子 还给我！</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:14:43,972 --> 00:14:46,182
<c.simplifiedchinese>你想要就用武力来拿！</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:14:46,268 --> 00:14:48,019
<c.simplifiedchinese>你应该很擅长才对</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:14:48,105 --> 00:14:49,606
<c.simplifiedchinese>给我站住！</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:14:50,944 --> 00:14:52,529
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦弟弟</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:14:53,658 --> 00:14:55,535
<c.simplifiedchinese>等一下！站住 别跑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:14:55,620 --> 00:14:57,038
<c.simplifiedchinese>追到他了</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:14:57,123 --> 00:14:58,541
<c.simplifiedchinese>做好准备吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:14:59,837 --> 00:15:03,465
<c.simplifiedchinese>守护之人的命运就悬在我的剑上</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:15:04,262 --> 00:15:06,180
<c.simplifiedchinese>绝不允许失败</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:15:06,892 --> 00:15:09,270
<c.simplifiedchinese>神谷活心流 明神弥彦！</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:15:09,355 --> 00:15:11,983
<c.simplifiedchinese>我来当你的对手！</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:15:12,069 --> 00:15:13,904
<c.simplifiedchinese>他被困住了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:15:16,494 --> 00:15:18,371
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们在做什么 白痴？</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:15:18,457 --> 00:15:20,083
<c.simplifiedchinese>一个一个上！</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:15:26,139 --> 00:15:27,307
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:15:27,391 --> 00:15:29,268
<c.simplifiedchinese>他假装被追</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:15:29,354 --> 00:15:33,524
<c.simplifiedchinese>其实是把人引进狭窄的地方
展开一对一的对决</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:15:33,612 --> 00:15:34,988
<c.simplifiedchinese>他发现了</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:15:35,074 --> 00:15:37,242
<c.simplifiedchinese>但这就是你的葬身之地</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:15:37,328 --> 00:15:39,205
<c.simplifiedchinese>他没有退路了</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:15:39,290 --> 00:15:40,958
<c.simplifiedchinese>慢慢逼近他</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:15:41,669 --> 00:15:43,588
<c.simplifiedchinese>不用手下留情</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:15:43,673 --> 00:15:48,261
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算杀一、两个人
只要把尸体埋了就不会有人知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:15:51,022 --> 00:15:52,190
<c.simplifiedchinese>愣着干什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:15:52,274 --> 00:15:54,151
<c.simplifiedchinese>快上！</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:16:02,670 --> 00:16:04,255
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个十字刀疤</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:16:04,340 --> 00:16:06,676
<c.simplifiedchinese>听说不好惹…</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:16:06,762 --> 00:16:09,181
<c.simplifiedchinese>打手斩左也在！</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:16:09,267 --> 00:16:10,268
<c.simplifiedchinese>快跑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:16:10,352 --> 00:16:11,854
<c.simplifiedchinese>不然就死定了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:16:11,939 --> 00:16:13,983
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂！你们这些胆小鬼！</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:16:17,993 --> 00:16:21,413
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们的出场就结束了</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:16:21,499 --> 00:16:23,334
<c.simplifiedchinese>是呀</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:16:23,420 --> 00:16:27,757
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过你怎么知道在下在这里？</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:16:27,846 --> 00:16:29,556
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下明明没有告诉任何人</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:16:30,142 --> 00:16:31,435
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然知道了</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:16:31,519 --> 00:16:33,438
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算这是“弥彦的战斗”</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:16:33,523 --> 00:16:37,736
<c.simplifiedchinese>他要是输了
小姑娘燕和红牛酒馆都会陷入危险</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:16:37,824 --> 00:16:40,744
<c.simplifiedchinese>以你的性格不会袖手旁观</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:16:40,830 --> 00:16:47,378
<c.simplifiedchinese>你为人那么傻那么善良
怎么会把那句狮子的谚语付诸实践？</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:16:48,136 --> 00:16:51,014
<c.simplifiedchinese>真不知这是夸还是损…</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:16:51,100 --> 00:16:54,229
<c.simplifiedchinese>无论如何 接下来就是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:16:54,315 --> 00:16:57,902
<c.simplifiedchinese>是啊 真正的一对一对决</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:16:58,406 --> 00:16:59,658
<c.simplifiedchinese>没想到有一天</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:16:59,742 --> 00:17:06,666
<c.simplifiedchinese>我长冈干雄流的真传剑术
竟然用来对付一个小屁孩！</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:17:10,055 --> 00:17:11,306
<c.simplifiedchinese>我能看穿…</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:17:13,353 --> 00:17:14,229
<c.simplifiedchinese>头！</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:17:16,818 --> 00:17:19,904
<c.simplifiedchinese>认真起来 我也能看穿他的招式</c.simplifiedchinese>

314
00:17:20,534 --> 00:17:23,912
<c.simplifiedchinese>每天的训练得到了回报</c.simplifiedchinese>

315
00:17:24,792 --> 00:17:28,379
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然不想承认 但还是要感谢薰</c.simplifiedchinese>

316
00:17:29,427 --> 00:17:31,554
<c.simplifiedchinese>臭小子！</c.simplifiedchinese>

317
00:17:33,226 --> 00:17:34,394
<c.simplifiedchinese>这么晚了</c.simplifiedchinese>

318
00:17:34,980 --> 00:17:37,107
<c.simplifiedchinese>女孩子一个人在外面很危险的哦</c.simplifiedchinese>

319
00:17:39,196 --> 00:17:40,656
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是神谷薰</c.simplifiedchinese>

320
00:17:40,741 --> 00:17:42,701
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦的剑术师父</c.simplifiedchinese>

321
00:17:43,622 --> 00:17:45,081
<c.simplifiedchinese>你是来阻止那个男人的吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

322
00:17:48,214 --> 00:17:49,090
<c.simplifiedchinese>很遗憾</c.simplifiedchinese>

323
00:17:49,175 --> 00:17:52,553
<c.simplifiedchinese>小燕你是没法阻止他的</c.simplifiedchinese>

324
00:17:53,516 --> 00:17:55,185
<c.simplifiedchinese>都交给弥彦吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

325
00:17:55,980 --> 00:17:58,650
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我们来做个约定吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

326
00:17:58,735 --> 00:17:59,903
<c.simplifiedchinese>约定？</c.simplifiedchinese>

327
00:18:00,489 --> 00:18:04,076
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果弥彦赢了 小燕你要坚强起来</c.simplifiedchinese>

328
00:18:05,415 --> 00:18:08,168
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要被无聊的陈旧观念束缚住</c.simplifiedchinese>

329
00:18:08,254 --> 00:18:11,549
<c.simplifiedchinese>下次一开始就坚决对他说不</c.simplifiedchinese>

330
00:18:12,596 --> 00:18:16,475
<c.simplifiedchinese>时代变了 现在是四民平等的时代</c.simplifiedchinese>

331
00:18:16,562 --> 00:18:20,024
<c.simplifiedchinese>但如果人们的观念没变就没意义了</c.simplifiedchinese>

332
00:18:21,030 --> 00:18:22,699
<c.simplifiedchinese>臭小子！</c.simplifiedchinese>

333
00:18:22,783 --> 00:18:24,702
<c.simplifiedchinese>结束了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

334
00:18:24,787 --> 00:18:26,163
<c.simplifiedchinese>长冈干雄流…</c.simplifiedchinese>

335
00:18:26,249 --> 00:18:27,417
<c.simplifiedchinese>必杀</c.simplifiedchinese>

336
00:18:27,501 --> 00:18:29,670
<c.simplifiedchinese>浮足落！</c.simplifiedchinese>

337
00:18:33,513 --> 00:18:35,515
<c.simplifiedchinese>糟了 我的右脚…</c.simplifiedchinese>

338
00:18:35,600 --> 00:18:36,727
<c.simplifiedchinese>要赢啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

339
00:18:36,811 --> 00:18:39,188
<c.simplifiedchinese>一定要赢啊 弥彦！</c.simplifiedchinese>

340
00:18:40,485 --> 00:18:41,611
<c.simplifiedchinese>是啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

341
00:18:41,696 --> 00:18:46,492
<c.simplifiedchinese>守护之人的命运就悬在我的剑上！</c.simplifiedchinese>

342
00:18:53,720 --> 00:18:56,181
<c.simplifiedchinese>我…要赢！</c.simplifiedchinese>

343
00:19:02,154 --> 00:19:03,405
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以说</c.simplifiedchinese>

344
00:19:03,907 --> 00:19:07,035
<c.simplifiedchinese>你怎么在这 薰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

345
00:19:09,835 --> 00:19:11,337
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有…</c.simplifiedchinese>

346
00:19:11,422 --> 00:19:13,716
<c.simplifiedchinese>屋顶上那两个！</c.simplifiedchinese>

347
00:19:18,144 --> 00:19:19,771
<c.simplifiedchinese>春天哪来的蝉鸣啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

348
00:19:20,524 --> 00:19:21,566
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是的</c.simplifiedchinese>

349
00:19:21,651 --> 00:19:23,861
<c.simplifiedchinese>一群爱操心的家伙</c.simplifiedchinese>

350
00:19:25,492 --> 00:19:27,661
<c.simplifiedchinese>我送小燕回家</c.simplifiedchinese>

351
00:19:27,746 --> 00:19:28,997
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们先回去吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

352
00:19:29,082 --> 00:19:31,751
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 路上小心</c.simplifiedchinese>

353
00:19:31,838 --> 00:19:34,298
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的谢谢你 弥彦</c.simplifiedchinese>

354
00:19:34,385 --> 00:19:36,053
<c.simplifiedchinese>道谢就不必了</c.simplifiedchinese>

355
00:19:36,138 --> 00:19:41,018
<c.simplifiedchinese>我只是不喜欢看见别人
战战兢兢 畏畏缩缩的样子</c.simplifiedchinese>

356
00:19:41,106 --> 00:19:43,024
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯 所以</c.simplifiedchinese>

357
00:19:43,611 --> 00:19:46,823
<c.simplifiedchinese>我以后不会再战战兢兢的了</c.simplifiedchinese>

358
00:19:49,373 --> 00:19:51,166
<c.simplifiedchinese>那明天</c.simplifiedchinese>

359
00:19:51,252 --> 00:19:52,253
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们在红牛见</c.simplifiedchinese>

360
00:19:53,715 --> 00:19:55,884
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样又一件事圆满解决…</c.simplifiedchinese>

361
00:19:55,969 --> 00:19:58,221
<c.simplifiedchinese>不 还没有</c.simplifiedchinese>

362
00:19:58,808 --> 00:20:02,687
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们还不知道这小家伙
去打工的理由呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

363
00:20:02,774 --> 00:20:06,904
<c.simplifiedchinese>你要是还坚决不说 那我就…</c.simplifiedchinese>

364
00:20:06,991 --> 00:20:08,159
<c.simplifiedchinese>好吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

365
00:20:08,244 --> 00:20:09,996
<c.simplifiedchinese>那我说…</c.simplifiedchinese>

366
00:20:10,498 --> 00:20:12,792
<c.simplifiedchinese>我想买逆刃刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

367
00:20:12,878 --> 00:20:16,548
<c.simplifiedchinese>当我和剑心一样厉害时
我也要有一把逆刃刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

368
00:20:16,636 --> 00:20:19,388
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在我是在提前攒钱</c.simplifiedchinese>

369
00:20:23,065 --> 00:20:24,483
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦用逆刃刀！</c.simplifiedchinese>

370
00:20:24,568 --> 00:20:27,071
<c.simplifiedchinese>笑什么啊 你个鸡冠头！</c.simplifiedchinese>

371
00:20:27,156 --> 00:20:29,116
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以我才瞒着你们</c.simplifiedchinese>

372
00:20:29,202 --> 00:20:31,829
<c.simplifiedchinese>听好了 千万别告诉薰</c.simplifiedchinese>

373
00:20:31,916 --> 00:20:34,460
<c.simplifiedchinese>她也肯定会笑我</c.simplifiedchinese>

374
00:20:34,546 --> 00:20:37,675
<c.simplifiedchinese>&lrm;-但我已经听到了
&lrm;-好了 不准说出去！</c.simplifiedchinese>

375
00:20:39,598 --> 00:20:41,475
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

376
00:20:41,560 --> 00:20:42,561
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦</c.simplifiedchinese>

377
00:20:43,690 --> 00:20:46,067
<c.simplifiedchinese>逆刃刀很贵的</c.simplifiedchinese>

378
00:20:46,152 --> 00:20:47,320
<c.simplifiedchinese>很贵吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

379
00:20:47,406 --> 00:20:48,949
<c.simplifiedchinese>很贵…</c.simplifiedchinese>

380
00:20:49,033 --> 00:20:50,243
<c.simplifiedchinese>很贵啊…</c.simplifiedchinese>

381
00:22:38,251 --> 00:22:39,377
<c.simplifiedchinese>好</c.simplifiedchinese>

382
00:22:47,520 --> 00:22:51,232
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一集 《那个男人 雷十太》</c.simplifiedchinese>

